         into native\payload\ before the standalone publish (build-release.ps1). ParentalNativeInstall.EnsureShipped
         extracts these to Core\litebox\parental-native\ at boot; the in-app Install button deploys them on demand.
         The light zip ships them loose there instead (build-release.ps1). All runtime-agnostic — no per-TFM. -->
    <EmbeddedResource Include="native\payload\winhttp.dll.api"><LogicalName>parental-native/winhttp.dll.api</LogicalName></EmbeddedResource>
